{"id":"vod_bf_35787","vodId":"35787","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"问题儿童都来自异世界","name_cn":"问题儿童都来自异世界","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-36/c0afdd76e1d72c82a55cae5f5117ac85.jpg"},"summary":"在一个晴朗明媚的日子里，自称废柴的学生君逆回十六夜（浅沼晋太郎 配音）、温柔善良爱护小动物的春日部耀（中岛爱 配音）以及高傲自大的大小姐久远飞鸟（布里德卡特•塞拉•惠美 配音）各自收到一封邀请函，信中说道：“告知烦恼众多、拥有异能的少男少女，如果期望一试自己的才能，那么就抛弃世上的一切，到我等的‘箱庭’来”。原来他们三人均为拥有超能力的问题儿童。似乎接受了邀请，他们被抛入风景秀美的箱庭世界，并遇见说明人黑兔（野水伊织 配音）。十六夜他们得知，必须运用天赐的特异功能在箱庭进行难度不等的神魔游戏。不按常理出牌的主人公以及藏着无数秘密的箱庭，一切变得好玩起来……　　本片根据竜ノ湖太郎（文）、天之有（插画）的原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:00:11","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"OVA","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241018H73YArSVindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241018jheMQS8Findex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/wentiertongdulaiziyishijie/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241018YAwB4pyCindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/wentiertongdulaiziyishijie/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/wentiertongdulaiziyishijie/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241018yny3xNymindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/wentiertongdulaiziyishijie/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241018n7ICOUAuindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241018YDhoKqQaindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/wentiertongdulaiziyishijie/第10集/index.m3u8"}]}],"sn